ented a circular pendulum that moved in a smooth, continuous circle rather than swinging back and forth. Y also wrote the first printed book on the subject in 1657, titled De Ratiociniis in Ludo Aleae (On Reasoning in Games of Chance). ID X and Y.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T18:16:03Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "newtyon", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T18:16:07Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "leibniz?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T18:16:10Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "or huygens?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T18:16:13Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Is X ‎", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T18:16:22Z", "username": "A", "text": "Bernoulli", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T18:16:28Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Hearing about him for the first time.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T18:16:36Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Huygens is Y", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T18:16:37Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Christiaan", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]